---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Part-Time Care Options - Marietta Childcare"
  description="Explore Marietta Childcare's flexible part-time care options including drop-in care and part-time enrollment with flexible scheduling.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/nap_time_cozy_blanket_background.jpg" 
        alt="Part-time care" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Part-Time Care Options</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Flexible part-time care including drop-in options and part-time enrollment with scheduling that fits your family.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare offers flexible part-time care options including drop-in care and part-time enrollment. The Part-Time Care Options at Marietta Childcare provide families with flexible scheduling that fits their unique needs and budgets.
        </p>

        <h2>Flexible Scheduling</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's Part-Time Care Options include flexible scheduling to accommodate various family needs. The Part-Time Care Options allow families to choose the days and hours that work best for their situation.
        </p>

        <h2>Drop-In Care</h2>
        <p>
          The Part-Time Care Options at Marietta Childcare include drop-in care for families needing occasional childcare. Marietta Childcare's drop-in care provides reliable, quality care on an as-needed basis.
        </p>

        <h2>Part-Time Enrollment</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare offers part-time enrollment options for families who need regular but not full-time care. The Part-Time Care Options include 2-day, 3-day, and 4-day weekly programs.
        </p>

        <h2>Affordable Options</h2>
        <p>
          The Part-Time Care Options at Marietta Childcare are designed to be affordable for families with varying budgets. Marietta Childcare offers competitive pricing for part-time programs and flexible payment options.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Part-Time Options</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ 2-day programs</li>
            <li>✓ 3-day programs</li>
            <li>✓ 4-day programs</li>
            <li>✓ Drop-in care</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible hours</li>
            <li>✓ Custom scheduling</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-secondary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Benefits</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Affordable pricing</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible scheduling</li>
            <li>✓ Quality education</li>
            <li>✓ Safe environment</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible payment</li>
            <li>✓ All age groups</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 p-8 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Flexible Care for Your Family</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Marietta Childcare's Part-Time Care Options provide the flexibility families need. The Part-Time Care Options allow you to choose the schedule that works best for your family's unique situation.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          Learn More About Part-Time Care
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Programs & Resources</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/programs/full-time-care" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Full-Time Care →</a>
          <a href="/faq/how-much-childcare-cost" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Pricing Information →</a>
          <a href="/faq/enrollment-process" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Enrollment Process →</a>
          <a href="/programs" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">All Programs →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
